  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你知道伤药吗？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E590534F24836F5417FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道伤药吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请给在对战中受伤的\n宝可梦用这个吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E590534F24836F5417FF1F00100001BE01000A8BF77ED957285BF962184E2D53D74F247684000A5B9D53EF68A675288FD94E2A5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要用了伤药，\n就算不去宝可梦中心，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也能让宝可梦恢复活力！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898175284E864F24836FFF0C000A5C317B974E0D53BB5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3FF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F80FD8BA95B9D53EF68A66062590D6D3B529BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您要来一个吗？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8898167654E004E2A5417FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "免费送您一个\n密阿雷格雷派饼。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514D8D39900160A84E004E2A000A5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "免费送的密阿雷格雷派饼\n每位只能送一个。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514D8D39900176845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C000A6BCF4F4D53EA80FD90014E004E2A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好精灵球了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D7CBE707574034E865417FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果要进入野生特区，\n精灵球可是必需品呀。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C89818FDB516591CE751F7279533AFF0C000A7CBE7075740353EF662F5FC5970054C1544030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "按住<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0002>ZL键好好瞄准之后\n再投精灵球吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63094F4F00100002BD0A0002005A004C952E597D597D778451C64E4B540E000A518D62957CBE707574035427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "移动地点！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79FB52A8573070B9FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果有第一次看到的宝可梦中心，\n你可记得要去看看啊！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这样就能把它作为\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>移动地点<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>添加到地图上。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n也算是为了让你牢牢记住这条有用的建议，\n就请你收下这个瞬发之羽吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，你在密阿雷逛过的地方越多，\n去各种地方就会变得越方便！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C4F6057285BC6963F96F7901B8FC77684573065B98D8A591AFF0C000A53BB540479CD573065B95C314F1A53D85F978D8A65B94FBFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茉蜜姬调查！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8309871C59EC8C0367E5FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把3号野生特区里\n所有种类的野生宝可梦都捉到之后，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n得到了茉蜜姬调查的报酬！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我很开心，所以多余的球就给你吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211628A003353F791CE751F7279533A91CC000A6240670979CD7C7B768491CE751F5B9D53EF68A690FD634952304E4B540EFF0C00100001BE00000A5F9752304E868309871C59EC8C0367E5768462A5916CFF0100100001BE01000A62115F885F005FC3FF0C62404EE5591A4F59768474035C317ED94F60542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "茉蜜姬调查这个活动，只要努力参与\n就能得到超多划算的奖励！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8309871C59EC8C0367E58FD94E2A6D3B52A8FF0C53EA898152AA529B53C24E0E000A5C3180FD5F9752308D85591A52127B977684595652B1FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全息传送梯！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5168606F4F20900168AFFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我对全息传送梯还不太了解，但它运用\n最新技术让上下之间的传送成为了可能！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那东西这么厉害，让我很震惊，\n所以我就送你一样好东西吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BF95168606F4F20900168AF8FD84E0D592A4E8689E3FF0C4F465B838FD07528000A670065B06280672F8BA94E0A4E0B4E4B95F476844F20900162104E3A4E8653EF80FDFF0100100001BE01000A90A34E1C897F8FD94E4853895BB3FF0C8BA962115F88970760CAFF0C000A62404EE562115C3190014F604E006837597D4E1C897F5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你看到全息传送梯，\n请务必去试一试哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F60770B52305168606F4F20900168AFFF0C000A8BF752A15FC553BB8BD54E008BD554E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第2重要的是钱。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C003291CD89817684662F94B1300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在密阿雷的各种地方\n都有亮闪闪的东西掉在地上，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n四处捡来全卖掉，即刻成为有钱人！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n来！我把捡来的小蘑菇送给你，\n拿去宝可梦中心卖钱吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BC6963F96F77684540479CD573065B9000A90FD67094EAE95EA95EA76844E1C897F6389572857304E0AFF0C00100001BE00000A56DB590463616765516853566389FF0C5373523B62104E3A670994B14EBAFF0100100001BE01000A6765FF016211628A6361676576845C0F861183C790017ED94F60FF0C000A62FF53BB5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3535694B1542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不可思议的是，\n亮闪闪的东西还会重新出现哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D53EF601D8BAE7684662FFF0C000A4EAE95EA95EA76844E1C897F8FD84F1A91CD65B051FA73B054E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有个好东西。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E2A597D4E1C897F300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可丽饼虽然已经卖完了，\n但我还有个好东西哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来！给你先制之爪！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4E3D997C867D71365DF27ECF53565B8C4E86FF0C000A4F4662118FD867094E2A597D4E1C897F54E6300200100001BE00000A6765FF017ED94F60514852364E4B722AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "携带先制之爪的宝可梦\n有时可以更快地使出招式哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
