      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "廊街！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5ECA8857FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用卖掉美丽之羽换来的钱\n来买些美丽的服饰如何？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7528535663897F8E4E3D4E4B7FBD63626765768494B1000A67654E704E9B7F8E4E3D7684670D997059824F55FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你想换装的话，\n只需要打开主菜单，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然后按下<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus键就可以啦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6060F3636288C576848BDDFF0C000A53EA9700898162535F004E3B83DC5355FF0C00100001BE00000A7136540E63094E0B00100002BD0A0005004D0069006E00750073952E5C3153EF4EE55566FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "经验糖果！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ECF9A8C7CD6679CFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道经验糖果吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n只要给宝可梦经验糖果，\n不知为何就能为它增加经验值！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我分几个给你，去确认一下。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E590537ECF9A8C7CD6679C5417FF1F00100001BE01000A53EA89817ED95B9D53EF68A67ECF9A8C7CD6679CFF0C000A4E0D77E54E3A4F555C3180FD4E3A5B83589E52A07ECF9A8C503CFF0100100001BE00000A6211520651E04E2A7ED94F60FF0C53BB786E8BA44E004E0B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能增加经验值的经验糖果……\n会是大人的味道吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD589E52A07ECF9A8C503C76847ECF9A8C7CD6679C20262026000A4F1A662F59274EBA7684547390535417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "招式学习器！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DB5F0F5B664E605668FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有时会好想找个洞钻进去……\n但却没法找到刚好可以钻的洞……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这种时候就只好自己来挖洞了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670965F64F1A597D60F3627E4E2A6D1E94BB8FDB53BB20262026000A4F4653746CA16CD5627E5230521A597D53EF4EE594BB76846D1E2026202600100001BE00000A8FD979CD65F650195C3153EA597D81EA5DF1676563166D1E4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "挖洞这个招式是先钻入地下消失不见，\n过一会儿后再朝对手发起攻击的招式！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n没错！只要钻入地下就不会被看到了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63166D1E8FD94E2A62DB5F0F662F514894BB516557304E0B6D8859314E0D89C1FF0C000A8FC74E004F1A513F540E518D671D5BF9624B53D18D77653B51FB768462DB5F0FFF0100100001BE00000A6CA19519FF0153EA898194BB516557304E0B5C314E0D4F1A88AB770B52304E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "逛街提示。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901B885763D0793A300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一边确认逛街提示一边逛街！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n当然，及时补充水分也很重要哦。\n这位训练家，我也送你一瓶水吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E008FB9786E8BA4901B885763D0793A4E008FB9901B8857FF0100100001BE01000A5F537136FF0C53CA65F6886551456C3452064E5F5F8891CD898154E63002000A8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C62114E5F90014F604E0074F66C345427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想确认逛街提示，\n只要从主菜单按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0001>L就好。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F3786E8BA4901B885763D0793AFF0C000A53EA89814ECE4E3B83DC5355630900100002BD0A0001004C5C31597D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘿！出租车！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563FFF0151FA79DF8F66FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "出租车也可以带乘客前往\n他们还没有去过的地方！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是说可以增加移动地点哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51FA79DF8F664E5F53EF4EE55E264E585BA2524D5F80000A4ED64EEC8FD86CA1670953BB8FC77684573065B9FF0100100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F8BF453EF4EE5589E52A079FB52A8573070B954E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过司机的聊天水平\n有些参差不齐就是了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC753F8673A7684804A59296C345E73000A67094E9B53C25DEE4E0D9F505C31662F4E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "奇怪的树果！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5947602A76846811679CFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "树果这东西真是奇妙！\n其中潜藏着各种各样的效果哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以你要不要来一个呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6811679C8FD94E1C897F771F662F59475999FF01000A51764E2D6F5C85CF7740540479CD5404683776846548679C54E6300200100001BE00000A62404EE54F6089814E0D898167654E004E2A5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确认过树果的说明以后，\n要好好利用它哦！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E8BA48FC76811679C76848BF4660E4EE5540EFF0C000A8981597D597D522975285B8354E6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿7",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把这个招式学习器！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A8FD94E2A62DB5F0F5B664E605668FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我来预知未来吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我预知到了，在这之后\n我会送你招式学习器。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA962116765988477E5672A67655427FF0100100001BE01000A6211988477E552304E86FF0C57288FD94E4B540E000A62114F1A90014F6062DB5F0F5B664E60566830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要使用预知未来这个招式，\n就会在一段时间后向对手之前所在的位置<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n发送一团念力进行攻击哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89814F7F7528988477E5672A67658FD94E2A62DB5F0FFF0C000A5C314F1A57284E006BB565F695F4540E54115BF9624B4E4B524D6240572876844F4D7F6E00100001BE00000A53D190014E0056E25FF5529B8FDB884C653B51FB54E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿;",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 4040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你平时会拍照吗？<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E7365F64F1A62CD71675417FF1F00100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus拍照拍出的照片\n可以拿来做各种处理，很神奇对吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n既然说到了神奇，我就把这个送给你吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 4100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "630900100002BD0A0005004D0069006E0075007362CD716762CD51FA768471677247000A53EF4EE562FF6765505A540479CD59047406FF0C5F88795E59475BF95427FF1F00100001BE00000A65E271368BF452304E86795E5947FF0C62115C31628A8FD94E2A90017ED94F605427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "按<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus拍照！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用滤镜功能来给照片换种风格，\n或是播放音乐来改变照片的氛围，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n多多尝试会很有趣的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 4216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "630900100002BD0A0005004D0069006E0075007362CD7167FF0100100001BE01000A75286EE4955C529F80FD67657ED971677247636279CD98CE683CFF0C000A6216662F64AD653E97F34E506765653953D87167724776846C1B56F4FF0C00100001BE00000A591A591A5C1D8BD54F1A5F8867098DA37684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "餐厅的全餐！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 4352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "99105385768451689910FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要去餐厅\n挑战宝可梦对战的全餐！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n没错！凡事重要的都是经验。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 4396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898153BB99105385000A631162185B9D53EF68A65BF96218768451689910FF0100100001BE00000A6CA19519FF0151E14E8B91CD8981768490FD662F7ECF9A8C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "首先我要挑战的是\n一星级的谱通餐馆！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 4468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9996514862118981631162187684662F000A4E00661F7EA776848C31901A99109986FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "彩色螺丝！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F69827287BA4E1DFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然这么做有点突然，\n但我要送你一个密阿雷格雷派饼。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n旁边那个人卖的密阿雷格雷派饼真是绝了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71368FD94E48505A670970B97A817136FF0C000A4F466211898190014F604E004E2A5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C300200100001BE00000A65C18FB990A34E2A4EBA535676845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C771F662F7EDD4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "建议你把彩色螺丝收集起来，\n拿到木根工程那里去。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n沿着这条路的另一侧\n稍微向前走一点就是木根工程了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5EFA8BAE4F60628A5F69827287BA4E1D653696C68D776765FF0C000A62FF5230672868395DE57A0B90A391CC53BB300200100001BE01000A6CBF77408FD967618DEF768453E64E004FA7000A7A0D5FAE5411524D8D704E0070B95C31662F672868395DE57A0B4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿G",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00470000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要买超级石咯！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 4780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E708D857EA777F354AFFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有活力碎片，\n昏厥的宝可梦也能继续战斗！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n毕竟要是没法战斗的话，\n也就不能超级进化了啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 4824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898167096D3B529B788E7247FF0C000A660F53A576845B9D53EF68A64E5F80FD7EE77EED62186597FF0100100001BE01000A6BD57ADF8981662F6CA16CD56218659776848BDDFF0C000A4E5F5C314E0D80FD8D857EA78FDB53164E86554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在春日大道的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>石头馆<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\n能买到超级石！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不过超级石的价格很贵，\n得靠ZA登峰战攒些钱才行！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 4924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728662565E559279053768400100002FF00000677F35934998600100002FF000000000A80FD4E7052308D857EA777F3FF0100100001BE01000A4E0D8FC78D857EA777F376844EF7683C5F888D35FF0C000A5F979760005A0041767B5CF0621865124E9B94B1624D884CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿K",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 5036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把你的心……！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 5048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A4F6076845FC320262026FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "电网是能将众人的心捉住不放的招式。\n这是它的招式学习器哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 5092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75357F51662F80FD5C064F174EBA76845FC363494F4F4E0D653E768462DB5F0F3002000A8FD9662F5B83768462DB5F0F5B664E60566854E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "电网是用电力形成的网子\n捕捉对手进行攻击的招式。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n能捉住对方这一点\n简直就像奇树小姐一样呀！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75357F51662F75287535529B5F62621076847F515B50000A635563495BF9624B8FDB884C653B51FB768462DB5F0F300200100001BE01000A80FD63494F4F5BF965B98FD94E0070B9000A7B8076F45C3150CF594768115C0F59D04E0068375440FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿O",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "踪迹这东西很碍事吧。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8E2A8FF98FD94E1C897F5F88788D4E8B5427300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说破坏掉踪迹就能获得\n超级碎片这一点是很好啦……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 5316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF47834574F63898E2A8FF95C3180FD83B75F97000A8D857EA7788E72478FD94E0070B9662F5F88597D5566202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但像是岩石、藤蔓、污泥之类的踪迹\n并不是所有招式都能消除掉，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以得多多尝试才行。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4650CF662F5CA977F3300185E4851330016C616CE54E4B7C7B76848E2A8FF9000A5E764E0D662F6240670962DB5F0F90FD80FD6D8896646389FF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE55F97591A591A5C1D8BD5624D884C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿S",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 5460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "时尚要从头发抓起！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 5472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65F65C1A89814ECE593453D162938D77FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说到美丽，就绕不开\n美丽之羽和美丽的头发！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 5520,
