      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超级……\n头晕……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 5900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857EA720262026000A59346655202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以从主菜单的设置\n把迷你地图的旋转设为ON哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我更喜欢会旋转的迷你地图，\n不过有些人用起来可能会头晕。",
