      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 6380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A5B9D53EF68A66062590D6D3B529BFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "直到一周前我还在卖可丽饼，\n但某天我突然灵光一闪，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n决定对外声称这里是宝可梦中心！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以事不宜迟，\n快把您的宝可梦交给我吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 6428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F452304E005468524D62118FD85728535653EF4E3D997CFF0C000A4F4667D0592962117A817136707551494E0095EAFF0C00100001BE00000A51B35B9A5BF9591658F079F08FD991CC662F5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC3FF0100100001BE01000A62404EE54E8B4E0D5B9C8FDFFF0C000A5FEB628A60A876845B9D53EF68A64EA47ED96211542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
